    "licencia": "Apache-2.0 (Qwen-Image y Qwen-Image-Lightning) — uso comercial permitido",
    "local": true
  },
  "prefijo_estilo": "flat vector illustration, soft warm palette of dusty orange and cream, clean rounded shapes, gentle gradients, no outlines, friendly modern character design, soft depth of field with a blurred background, calm low-contrast lighting that leaves the lower half quiet, no text, no watermark, wide 16:9 composition.",
